# Cloudflare Workers Static Assets: ko NEaugšupielādēt no output/atmina/.
# Formāts kā .gitignore; failam jābūt koka saknē (renderis to kopē ar
# _copy_host_config). Hostinga konfigurācija nav publisks saturs:
.htaccess
assets/htaccess.template
assets/_headers
assets/_redirects
assets/.assetsignore
